{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","title":"Systemic Fixing Guide for Behavioral Patterns","description":"Panduan praktis memperbaiki pola perilaku melalui pendekatan biopsikososial-kultural-spiritual.","tags":["handbook","growth","systemic-fixing"],"custom":{"description":"Panduan praktis memperbaiki pola perilaku melalui pendekatan biopsikososial-kultural-spiritual."},"fname":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"b7d016cfc067b39045b0130f2ad2dbbb","updated":1782198657969,"created":1782198657969,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","id":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.handbook","alias":"handbook","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.handbook"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","id":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.growth","alias":"growth","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.growth"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","id":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.systemic-fixing","alias":"systemic-fixing","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.systemic-fixing"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","id":"handbook.growth.systemic-fixing-guide","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":11,"offset":2110},"end":{"line":41,"column":76,"offset":2175},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework"}}],"anchors":{"systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns":{"type":"header","text":"Systemic Fixing Guide for Behavioral Patterns","value":"systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"overview":{"type":"header","text":"Overview","value":"overview","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-systemic-checklist":{"type":"header","text":"The Systemic Checklist","value":"the-systemic-checklist","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"1-biological-reset-stabilkan-tubuh":{"type":"header","text":"1. Biological Reset (Stabilkan Tubuh)","value":"1-biological-reset-stabilkan-tubuh","line":22,"column":0,"depth":3},"2-psychological-mapping-petakan-luka":{"type":"header","text":"2. Psychological Mapping (Petakan Luka)","value":"2-psychological-mapping-petakan-luka","line":29,"column":0,"depth":3},"3-social-calibration-pilih-lingkungan":{"type":"header","text":"3. Social Calibration (Pilih Lingkungan)","value":"3-social-calibration-pilih-lingkungan","line":35,"column":0,"depth":3},"4-cultural-audit-uji-mitos":{"type":"header","text":"4. Cultural Audit (Uji Mitos)","value":"4-cultural-audit-uji-mitos","line":41,"column":0,"depth":3},"5-spiritual-alignment-tentukan-gawang":{"type":"header","text":"5. Spiritual Alignment (Tentukan Gawang)","value":"5-spiritual-alignment-tentukan-gawang","line":46,"column":0,"depth":3},"summary-of-action":{"type":"header","text":"Summary of Action","value":"summary-of-action","line":51,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"p9p8pmhwbt20ewv1sznbfqe","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns\">Systemic Fixing Guide for Behavioral Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns-1\">Systemic Fixing Guide for Behavioral Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#systemic-fixing-guide-for-behavioral-patterns-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#overview\"></a></h2>\n<p>Memperbaiki pola batin (seperti \"takut tampil\" atau \"sulit peduli\") tidak bisa dilakukan hanya dengan \"sadar\". Perlu ada perbaikan ekosistem di seluruh layer.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-systemic-checklist\">The Systemic Checklist<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-systemic-checklist\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-biological-reset-stabilkan-tubuh\">1. Biological Reset (Stabilkan Tubuh)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#1-biological-reset-stabilkan-tubuh\"></a></h3>\n<p>Sebelum mencoba latihan psikologis, pastikan sistem saraf tidak dalam kondisi <em>over-inflamed</em>.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Tidur</strong>: Stabilkan jam tidur.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Gerak</strong>: Aktivitas fisik rutin untuk mengurangi stres kronik.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Digital Detox</strong>: Kurangi <em>doomscrolling</em> dan overstimulasi gadget.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Gizi</strong>: Perbaiki pola makan untuk mendukung fungsi otak.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-psychological-mapping-petakan-luka\">2. Psychological Mapping (Petakan Luka)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#2-psychological-mapping-petakan-luka\"></a></h3>\n<p>Jangan hanya melabeli diri, tapi cari sumber dan template-nya.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Identify Trigger</strong>: Apa event yang memicu respons defensif?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Trace Root</strong>: Dari mana template ini datang? (Misal: pengalaman masa kecil).</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Create New Learning</strong>: Buat prinsip baru (misal: \"Gue bisa peduli dengan batas\").</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-social-calibration-pilih-lingkungan\">3. Social Calibration (Pilih Lingkungan)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#3-social-calibration-pilih-lingkungan\"></a></h3>\n<p>Cari lingkungan yang membantu ego bertumbuh, bukan yang mengamini luka.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Audit Circle</strong>: Apakah teman-teman gue hanya memvalidasi sinisme gue?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Seek Feedback</strong>: Cari orang yang berani memberi koreksi sehat.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Safe Practice</strong>: Cari ruang kecil untuk latihan peran baru.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-cultural-audit-uji-mitos\">4. Cultural Audit (Uji Mitos)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#4-cultural-audit-uji-mitos\"></a></h3>\n<p>Identifikasi \"software\" budaya yang menghambat.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Challenge Norms</strong>: Apakah \"diam itu rendah hati\" sebenarnya adalah rasa malu yang terbungkus norma?</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Redefine Values</strong>: Ubah definisi \"peduli\" dari \"mengorbankan diri\" menjadi \"berkontribusi sehat\".</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-spiritual-alignment-tentukan-gawang\">5. Spiritual Alignment (Tentukan Gawang)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#5-spiritual-alignment-tentukan-gawang\"></a></h3>\n<p>Gunakan nilai hidup sebagai rem saat ego mulai membenarkan diri.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Value Check</strong>: Saat muncul pikiran \"gue gak perlu peduli\", tanya: \"Apakah ini nilai yang ingin gue bawa dalam hidup?\"</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <strong>Responsibility</strong>: Fokus pada tanggung jawab atas dampak diri, bukan hanya hak untuk diakui.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"summary-of-action\">Summary of Action<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#summary-of-action\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>Sadar <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Petakan <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Stabilkan Tubuh <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Latih Perilaku <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Kalibrasi Sosial.</strong></p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework\">Biopsychosocial-Cultural-Spiritual Framework</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">handbook (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">growth (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">systemic-fixing (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRe